      *
           MOVE INT-PERCAPIT                  TO COT-PERCAPIT
           MOVE MAE-FEPROAMO                  TO COT-F-AMORTI
           MOVE WS-PERCAP                     TO COT-PERCAP
           MOVE WS-TIPODIAS                   TO COT-TIPODIAS
           MOVE IEN-PERINT                    TO COT-PERINT
           MOVE INT-DIASCAL                   TO COT-DIASCAL
      *
           IF MAE-UGCDIPAG = 0
