           END-IF
      *
           MOVE MAE-UGCDIPAG                  TO WS-UGCDIPAG
           MOVE WS-UGCDIPAG                   TO COT-UGCDIPAG
           MOVE AHI-PORFINA-ACT               TO COT-PORC-FINAL
