                 MOVE ADE-ENTSUB(3:2)         TO UTR-FONDO
              ELSE
                 MOVE ADS-ENTSUB(3:2)         TO UTR-FONDO
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE CTE-GUIONES                TO UTR-FONDO
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-FILLER1
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-FILLER2
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-TIPGASTO
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-CONCONTA
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-FILLERQH
           MOVE SPACES                        TO UTR-FILLERHA
