      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                    502A-VALIDAR-TIPOCAR                        *
      * SE HACE EL LINK A LA RUTINA UR2CCGP0 QUE TRAE ALGUNOS DATOS    *
      * PARA EL COPY UGWCUTR                                           *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       502A-VALIDAR-TIPOCAR.
      *
           INITIALIZE  URWCCGP1
           MOVE WS-ENTIOFI                      TO CGP0-CCC-ENTIOFI
           MOVE WS-CUENTA                       TO CGP0-CCC-CUENTA
           MOVE 'P'                             TO CGP0-OPCION
      *
           EXEC CICS
               LINK PROGRAM ('UR2CCGP0')
               COMMAREA (URWCCGP1)
               NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC
      *
           IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL) OR
              CGP0-CODIGO-RETORNO = '90'

                MOVE 'LINK UR2CCGP0: 90'        TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                PERFORM 999999-ABEND-CICS

           END-IF
      *
           EVALUATE CGP0-CODIGO-RETORNO
              WHEN '00'
                   MOVE CGP0-COD-HOMOL-CARTERA  TO UTR-TIPOCAR
                   MOVE CGP0-COD-HOMOL-CALIFICA TO UTR-CALIFICA
                   MOVE CGP0-COD-HOMOL-TEMPORA  TO UTR-TEMPORA
              WHEN '10'
              WHEN '50'
                   MOVE CGP0-COD-ERROR          TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE CGP0-VAR1-ERROR         TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                   MOVE CGP0-VAR2-ERROR         TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
              WHEN '99'
                   MOVE CGP0-VAR1-ERROR         TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                   MOVE CGP0-VAR2-ERROR         TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
                   MOVE CGP0-SQLCODE            TO SQLCODE
                   MOVE CGP0-SQLERRM            TO SQLERRM
                   PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
              WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 'UGE1141'               TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE 'UR2CCGP0'              TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
           END-EVALUATE
      *
           IF C86A-RET-COD-ERROR NOT = SPACES
              PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-IF.

