               MOVE MAE-ENTIOFI                TO CPT-NUCTA(1:8)
               MOVE MAE-CUENTA                 TO CPT-NUCTA(9:10)
               MOVE SPACES                     TO CPT-NUMDO
                                                  CPT-DATOS-MIS
               MOVE CTE-0                      TO CPT-TIPO-DIVISA
      *
               EXEC CICS
                  LINK PROGRAM ('QH6CCPT0')
                  COMMAREA     (QHECCPT-01)
