                        WHEN CTE-COD-OK
COL08I                   IF C86A-OPCION-RECLAM NOT EQUAL 'A'
                          INITIALIZE UGTCLOG                               05224
                          MOVE CPT-CODIGO        TO LOG-TABLA           05224404
                          MOVE CPT-CONCEPTO-PROG TO LOG-DESCRIPCION(1:5)05224604
                          MOVE CPT-IMPORTE       TO LOG-IMPANT          05224704
                          MOVE UTR-FILLER1       TO LOG-DESCRIPCION(6:1)05224804
                          MOVE UTR-TIPOGAR       TO LOG-DESCRIPCION(7:3)05224904
                          PERFORM 999999-INSERT-UGDTLOG                 05225004
COL08F                   END-IF
                        WHEN OTHER
                           MOVE CPT-COD-ERROR  TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                           MOVE CPT-VAR1-ERROR TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                           MOVE CPT-VAR2-ERROR TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
                           PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                     END-EVALUATE
                  WHEN OTHER
                     MOVE 'QHE0002'            TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                     MOVE 'QH6CCPT0'           TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                     MOVE EIBRESP              TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
                     PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
               END-EVALUATE
            END-IF.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                    504-CIERRE-OPERACION                        *
      * PRUEBA TODO EL CIERRE ON-LINE                                  *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       504-CIERRE-OPERACION.
