      ******************************************************************
       2329-ACTUALITZAR-DRB.

           MOVE  MAE-ENTIOFI          TO DRB-ENTIOFI
           MOVE  MAE-CUENTA           TO DRB-CUENTA

           MOVE  MAE-PLAZO            TO DRB-UGCPLAZO
           IF ADS-INDINANT = 'V'
             IF  WS-DB2-FEVALOR NOT < MAE-FEFINCAR
             AND WS-REVER-CUOTAFIN = 'N'
             AND WS-REVER-OPCADQUI = 'N'
                MOVE  WS-IMPMINI      TO DRB-UGIQUOTA
             END-IF
           ELSE
             IF  WS-DB2-FEVALOR > MAE-FEFINCAR
             AND WS-REVER-CUOTAFIN = 'N'
             AND WS-REVER-OPCADQUI = 'N'
                MOVE  WS-IMPMINI      TO DRB-UGIQUOTA
             END-IF
           END-IF.
              MOVE 0 TO DRB-UGPQSACT
           IF WS-REVER-OPCADQUI = 'S'
              ADD WS-MES-CAPITAL TO DRB-UGSPDREB
           END-IF
           IF WS-CODTIAMO  = ( 'D' OR 'E' )
              COMPUTE DRB-UGSPDREB =  MAE-SALTEOR
              END-COMPUTE
           END-IF.
           IF MAE-UGYEMCED = 'S'
              PERFORM 2901-ACTUALIZAR-UGDTMAL
           END-IF
           MOVE  CAA-NETNAME-CONT     TO DRB-NETNAME-UMO
           MOVE  CAA-USERID           TO DRB-USERID-UMO
           MOVE  CAA-ENTIDAD          TO DRB-ENTITAT-UMO
           MOVE  CAA-CENTRO-CONT      TO DRB-CENTRE-UMO

           IF SI-FLEXIBLE
               PERFORM 2014C-RETROCESO-FLEXIBLE-MPF
           END-IF
      *EFR01-I
           IF SW-SI-PUNICA
