      *    MOVE 'UGRMG57Z'                 TO W-NOMBRE-FORMATO
      *    MOVE UGNC57Z                    TO W-CONT-FORMATO
      *
      *    PERFORM  777777-WRITEQ.
      *
      *    MOVE 'EN MONEDA CORRIENTE   ( P E S O S ) '
      *                                       TO G10Z-TITUUVR
