      *       MOVE SPACES                   TO W-CONTENIDO-TS
      *       MOVE 'UGRMG10P'               TO W-NOMBRE-FORMATO
      *       MOVE UGNC10P                  TO W-CONT-FORMATO
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE LENGTH OF UGNC10Z        TO W-LONG-TS
      *       MOVE SPACES                   TO W-CONTENIDO-TS
      *       MOVE 'UGRMG10B'               tO W-NOMBRE-FORMATO
      *       MOVE UGNC10Z                  TO W-CONT-FORMATO
      *    END-IF
      *    IF MAE-UGCIOPRE = 'C'
