           MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'UGDTUVR'               TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                 MOVE 'UPDATE UVR-11   '      TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
                 PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
           END-EVALUATE.
