      *    PERFORM 61-HALLAR-UVR
      *    MOVE UVR-WS-VALOR-UVR              TO G10Z-TLIQUID
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *  ESCRIBIMOS EL FORMATO CORRESPONDIENTE                         *
