       VALIDA-FACULTADES.
      *
           INITIALIZE  QGEC0010-AREA
                       QCECAUTF.
      *
           MOVE CAA-CODTRAN                   TO QGEC0010-CODITRAN
           MOVE 'UG '                         TO QGEC0010-CODAPLIC
