           EXEC CICS
                LINK PROGRAM('QG7C0010')
                COMMAREA (QGEC0010-AREA)
                NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC
      *
           EVALUATE QGEC0010-CODRETORN
              WHEN '1'
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN '2'
      ******************************************************************
      *    MANEJO DE SOBRANTES                                         *
      ******************************************************************
                 EVALUATE WS-CODFUN
                    WHEN 'U008'
                      MOVE 'UGE2057'              TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                      MOVE 'MANEJO DE LIBRANZAS ' TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERRORR
                      PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                    WHEN OTHER
                      MOVE 'UGE2057'              TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                      MOVE 'FACULTAD NO CONTROL.' TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERRORR
                      PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                 END-EVALUATE
              WHEN '3'
                 PERFORM  PEDIR-AUTORIZACION
                 PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              WHEN '4'
                 MOVE 'UGE1583'               TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                 MOVE ' 4 '                   TO C86A-RET-VAR1-ERROR
                 MOVE 'QG7C0010'              TO C86A-RET-VAR2-ERROR
                 PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              WHEN 5
                 MOVE 'UGE1631'               TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                 PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'UGE2056'               TO C86A-RET-COD-ERROR
                 PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
